(5. Key Takeaways) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Default to const for immutable bindings; use let only when variable reassignment is required. Never use var in modern code.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Closures allow functions to capture lexical scope state without global variable pollution.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Microtasks \(Promise.then, async/await continuations\) always execute before the next tick of the Macrotask queue.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Array methods like map\(\), filter\(\), and reduce\(\) promote functional, declarative programming paradigms.) Tj
0 -12 Td
